# Flashing Rule

Always flash firmware using STM32_Programmer_CLI:

```
& "C:\Program Files\STMicroelectronics\STM32Cube\STM32CubeProgrammer\bin\STM32_Programmer_CLI.exe" -c port=SWD mode=UR -w <binary_path> 0x08000000 -v -rst
```

- Use `mode=UR` (under reset) by default.
- Always verify (`-v`) and reset (`-rst`) after flashing.
- Binary is at: `prod-tester-motion-ctrl/build/zephyr/zephyr.bin`
- Do NOT use `west flash` or any other method.
